Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.92,0:00:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The End. Ow... Ugh...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.16,0:00:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.07,0:00:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You should really have a\Ndoctor take a look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.50,0:00:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, I already know that...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.12,0:00:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But I want you to give me a bit\Nof first aid in the meantime.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.78,0:00:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.20,0:00:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Fugo, you're not gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.44,0:00:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,AHHHHH!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.72,0:00:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you lost your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.46,0:00:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Did that just happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.52,0:00:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy shit, you sealed him\Nup like a freaking manga.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.16,0:00:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Narancia, you mind grabbing the\Nduct tape and wrapping up his midsection?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.54,0:00:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.45,0:00:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This hack job isn't going\Nto get infected, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.24,0:00:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, you'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.02,0:00:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's actually kind of growing on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.88,0:00:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,May I chime in?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.04,0:00:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Vagazzi, you've made me proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.86,0:00:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's thanks to all of your efforts\Nthat we made it to Capri alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.78,0:00:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Our would-be attackers have been neutralized\Nand are being held on the ship for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.18,0:00:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The obstacle has been cleared.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.14,0:00:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.16,0:00:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time like the present!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.62,0:00:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Our 10 billion lira treasure awaits!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.20,0:01:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough suspense.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.42,0:01:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd you hide it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.44,0:01:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A hidden safe at the bank? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.80,0:01:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have buried it in\Nsome cave on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.74,0:01:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to wait a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.84,0:01:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's this coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.28,0:01:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And why do we need to wait around?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.40,0:01:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.62,0:01:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you wait a few?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.18,0:01:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There are still some people left in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.58,0:01:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, think you could\Nclean this place later?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.32,0:01:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So you must be La Toilette?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.56,0:01:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.47,0:01:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.62,0:01:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If your name was La Toilette, that'd make\Nthis place your house, giving you a say.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.82,0:01:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, one calls the\Nshots in their own home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.62,0:01:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.53,0:01:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,if this isn't actually your house,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.62,0:01:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,then you really have no\Nbusiness ordering me around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.92,0:01:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.83,0:01:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it, moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.46,0:01:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What part of comeback\Nlater don't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.18,0:01:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.70,0:01:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what do you think you're doing, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.66,0:02:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.20,0:02:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell, user?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.72,0:02:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, I'll slice you apart! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.08,0:02:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Back off now, Narancia.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.54,0:02:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But I want to cut this fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.60,0:02:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Things aren't as they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.62,0:02:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.86,0:02:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That stern voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.96,0:02:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We've kept you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.22,0:02:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, bow your heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.04,0:02:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.28,0:02:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Pericolo, a Cape from Passione.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.74,0:02:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come all the way here for\Nthe 10 billion lira, Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.04,0:03:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.04,0:03:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,next
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.24,0:03:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.15,0:03:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Fukatu no tamashi, Dish yo?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.70,0:03:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.48,0:04:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I was the one who requested your\Nteam travel here in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.62,0:04:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, everyone at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.38,0:04:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be the rookie, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.02,0:04:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Si.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.08,0:04:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucerates told me all about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.44,0:04:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You are with Passione now, which\Nmakes you part of the Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.14,0:04:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I know we've only just met, but\Nby all means call me Mr. Pericolo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.64,0:04:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate that, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.56,0:04:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sunny, pardon the\Nrough reception earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.64,0:04:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,She hates it when people touch\Nher without her permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.18,0:04:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.72,0:04:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Not cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.63,0:04:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's yes, sir! Mr. Periculum.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.00,0:04:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If I may, why the elaborate disguise?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.04,0:04:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I have my reasons,\Nbut I'll clarify later.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.84,0:05:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Before that, are you\Npositive that you have it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.86,0:05:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The 10 billion lira\Ncontribution to the Family?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.12,0:05:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.03,0:05:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Right here, in fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.58,0:05:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Back it up a bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.86,0:05:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.98,0:05:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He said it's here! But where?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.94,0:05:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna have to be more specific.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.82,0:05:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but all I see are urinals.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.08,0:05:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.24,0:05:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You hid it inside of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.88,0:05:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I can't deny it was\Nsecure, but holy moly,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.66,0:05:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,if those guys knew what\Nthey were pissing on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.72,0:05:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, it's authentic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.66,0:05:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This necklace alone is worth at\Nleast seven or eight hundred million.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.72,0:05:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati, I won't badger you for details\Non how you obtain this cash of riches.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.10,0:05:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The Family cares not about your methods,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.52,0:05:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,only that you follow\Nthrough with the funds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.08,0:05:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.00,0:05:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're putting it away already?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.28,0:05:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Could I touch it a little?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.80,0:05:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd settle for a whiff!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.06,0:06:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This treasure is proof\Nincarnate that the man standing
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.96,0:06:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,before us today is one of\Ntremendous intellect and faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.38,0:06:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done, Bucciarati. You did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.28,0:06:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I hereby promote you to the rank of Cape.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.44,0:06:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you hear that? He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.26,0:06:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,After all that,\NBucciarati's finally a Cape!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.10,0:06:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Since Polpo is no longer among the living,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.84,0:06:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,you are now the successor to\Nthe entirety of his territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.32,0:06:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll oversee all interests\Nrelated to the Family in Napoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.32,0:06:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,including gambling, extortion,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.38,0:06:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,port contraband, and restaurant\Nand hotel operations.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.14,0:06:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,50 % goes to the Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.86,0:06:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest is yours for the taking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.80,0:06:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.80,0:06:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So much power just like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.04,0:06:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,With Bucciarati's smarts and charisma, our\Nlittle gang is gonna be rolling in dough!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.08,0:06:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Man,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.99,0:06:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,it's like everything\Nstarted being set into
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.38,0:06:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,motion once that new guy Giorno got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.36,0:06:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a crazy good luck charm!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.52,0:06:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and there's one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.34,0:07:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you haven't had time to digest\Nyour new duties as Polpo's successor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.28,0:07:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But you should know he still\Nhad one job left unfinished.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.34,0:07:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Naturally this responsibility\Nwill now rest on your shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.04,0:07:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you willing to\Naccept his final mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.94,0:07:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be a heavy burden to bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.98,0:07:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm to finish what he started.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.66,0:07:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Be aware this is a direct\Norder from the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.62,0:07:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.14,0:07:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. Unreal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.68,0:07:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't this the same boss,\Nno one's ever met in person?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.24,0:07:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And now we're getting\Nan order right from him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.76,0:07:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.88,0:07:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll deliver his words myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.72,0:07:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mission is to safeguard\Nthe boss's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.10,0:07:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Laying down your lives if needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.04,0:07:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,End of message.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.60,0:07:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,His daughter? The boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.60,0:07:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he say daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.70,0:07:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The daughter of the boss we were planning\Non tracking down and eliminating?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.32,0:07:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Your safeguarding obligations begin now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.42,0:08:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm turning her over to you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.28,0:08:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Turning her over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.68,0:08:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.90,0:08:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Could that guy be?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.66,0:08:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No that woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.54,0:08:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,She must be the boss's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.90,0:08:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Could that really be her I have to
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.10,0:08:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you know, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.52,0:08:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead Trish
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.36,0:08:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, stay by her side.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.30,0:08:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,She is now our priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.80,0:08:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.08,0:08:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Her name is Trish Una,\Nand she's 15 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.18,0:08:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The name Una comes from her mother, so\Nit has no association with the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.20,0:08:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Trish has also never met the boss, so\Nshe doesn't know anything about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.92,0:08:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati, as you know, no one has\Nknowledge of the boss's true identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.08,0:08:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But of course, even someone\Nlike the boss has a past.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.84,0:08:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,His youth is especially intriguing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.98,0:09:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Two months ago, in a hospital\Nin a small town in Calabria,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.30,0:09:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,a woman named Donatella\Nsuccumbed to illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.00,0:09:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just days before her death,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.12,0:09:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,she initiated a frantic search\Nfor a man named Solidonazo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.14,0:09:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The man she was looking\Nfor was Trish's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.92,0:09:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I assume it was a final act of love for a
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.50,0:09:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,daughter who'd soon be\Nleft to fend for herself,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.40,0:09:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.32,0:09:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,She couldn't find him\Nbecause he doesn't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.18,0:09:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It was just an alias, used by the boss in\Nhis youth to conceal his true identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.64,0:09:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.92,0:09:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But he who seeks Naso\Nmust exercise caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.40,0:09:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone with any standing whatsoever in\NPassione knows to take these words to heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.24,0:09:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,To peer into the depths of the boss's\Npast is to defy the Family itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.38,0:09:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Word of Donatella spread like wildfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.38,0:09:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,As you can imagine, with news\Nof a daughter, rumors exploded.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.54,0:10:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, the hearsay\Nreached the boss too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.76,0:10:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,His resolution was unsurprisingly swift.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.18,0:10:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,By way of several intermediaries,\Nhe extended his order.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.92,0:10:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Upon Donatella's death, I\Nwas to become her guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.34,0:10:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have known instinctively.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.04,0:10:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He lived his life without\Nknowing she had ever existed,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.38,0:10:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,yet suddenly he knew Trish was his own
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.12,0:10:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.03,0:10:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Shortly after taking\NTrish into my custody,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.90,0:10:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I discovered someone was attempting to hunt\Nher down and take the girl out for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.66,0:10:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Had the directive arrived\N30 minutes later, I've no
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.30,0:10:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,doubt Trish's pursuers\Nwould have taken her away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.12,0:10:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They would have surely killed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.30,0:10:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But who'd do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.80,0:10:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would want to kill\Nthe boss's daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.92,0:10:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Traitors to the Family, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.12,0:10:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's no telling how many there are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.64,0:10:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,They are attempting to\Noverthrow the boss and
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.76,0:10:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,take control of all the\Ndrug trafficking routes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.42,0:10:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Drugs again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.60,0:11:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,These idiotas have convinced themselves the\Ngirl possesses secret intel on the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.98,0:11:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They want intelligence\Non how to topple the boss
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.22,0:11:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,when they carry out their coup.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.58,0:11:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But she has no such knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.82,0:11:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Trish is a vulnerable teen
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.10,0:11:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,in a strange new life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.76,0:11:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How long will we protect her?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.64,0:11:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,About seven days.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.76,0:11:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And likely it'll be\Neven shorter than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.30,0:11:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be relieved of duty once\Nthe boss eliminates the traitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.56,0:11:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave this island immediately\Nand place her under concealment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.52,0:11:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This arrangement is top secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.70,0:11:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the boss and I know of it. Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.08,0:11:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Pericolo, to clarify, this\Nmission was first Polpo's.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.42,0:11:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Signore?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.08,0:11:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.66,0:11:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That our enemies are stand-users.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.12,0:11:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say that is a good guess, my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.76,0:11:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,In all likelihood they'll\Nbe working in teams as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.32,0:11:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, we don't yet\Nknow how many there are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.56,0:11:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't possess a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.58,0:11:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I've now done everything\NI can to assist you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.66,0:12:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If I obtain further intel,\NI'll find a way to reach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.94,0:12:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you need something?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.56,0:12:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.64,0:12:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,will you be, well, um, are you the group\Nthat'll be escorting me from here on out?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.04,0:12:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.58,0:12:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The six of us are here for you, Trish.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.14,0:12:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,While you're with us, we will\Nprotect you with our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.30,0:12:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.21,0:12:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Then do me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.58,0:12:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you please take off\Nyour jacket for just a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.16,0:12:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me to take off my jacket?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.88,0:12:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But what for?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.79,0:12:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, just take it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.98,0:12:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, I have no interest in\Nseeing you devoid of clothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.40,0:12:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You've made that clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.70,0:12:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm out of handkerchiefs,\Nso go buy me one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.86,0:13:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,While you're at it, get more nylons\Nand Givenchy blush number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.42,0:13:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and those nylons better be the\Nones with the garter at the thigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.78,0:13:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And grab a copy of Vogitalia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.36,0:13:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Mineral water would be nice too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.94,0:13:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But it has to be from France.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.24,0:13:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather keel over than\Ndrink that other stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.92,0:13:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're done ogling the\Nscenery, get started on that list.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.38,0:13:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Protect the daughter of the boss, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.82,0:13:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,One minute we're hunting the bastard down,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.22,0:13:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,and the next we're face to\Nface with his flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.82,0:13:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, this has to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.84,0:13:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If we really follow through on this,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.36,0:13:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,the boss will give Bucciarati the\Nsame kind of trust he gave Polpo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.10,0:13:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But if we fail, our story won't end well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.82,0:13:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone aboard this ship is\Naware of that cruel reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.36,0:13:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.86,0:13:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Chill out, sweetie baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.58,0:13:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just trying to show you some love.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.32,0:14:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.96,0:14:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit moving around so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.88,0:14:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,can't you see i'm trying to read these\Nmessages at 9 25 this morning officials
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.96,0:14:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,at the prison in naples were shocked to\Ndiscover that Papa had shot himself dead
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.50,0:14:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,on a stick i thought for sure Papa would\Nbe the girl's guardian if it's not him
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.78,0:14:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it then? Who'd stick their neck\Nout to look after that disappearing act,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.24,0:14:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Trish.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.00,0:14:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I better get after it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.90,0:14:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Find them, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.70,0:14:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would be more capable of\Nprotecting her than Polpo?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.32,0:14:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They definitely have to be a couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.84,0:14:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No one else would be assigned\Nto such an important job.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.84,0:14:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Them being a stand user\Nis also a no-brainer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.08,0:14:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The question is, who the\Nhell checks all those boxes?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.22,0:15:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Groceries check surroundings clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.64,0:15:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see so I'm supposed to go\Nthrough here, make a turn there, end.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.72,0:15:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,up back on this street and then head\Nin the opposite direction right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.64,0:15:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.52,0:15:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia, you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.36,0:15:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a list of groceries from the\Ngroup, along with everything else we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.28,0:15:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And these are the keys to the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.68,0:15:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Now listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.90,0:15:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I have faith in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.44,0:15:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This will be a walk in the park.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.70,0:15:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,One more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.14,0:15:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No one has the faintest idea\Nour group is hiding out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.68,0:15:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even the vintners out front\Nare aware of our presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.68,0:15:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're done with the shopping,\NI want you to retrace your path.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.56,0:15:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Then do it again more times\Nthan you think necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.78,0:15:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, make a U-turn every once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.40,0:15:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That way you'll know whether\Nanyone is tailing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.46,0:16:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, I want you to take the\Ncar I left for you in the parking lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.20,0:16:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Then and only then do I\Nwant you to come home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.34,0:16:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No one should have any inkling that\Nwe're looking after the boss's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.38,0:16:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But just in case someone\Ndoes know what we're up to,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.42,0:16:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,this runaround strategy should\Nkeep them off our trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.48,0:16:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.58,0:16:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We need the things on the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.60,0:16:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That much is still true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.76,0:16:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,However, it's absolutely imperative that\Nnobody finds our hideout. Crying out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.04,0:16:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it I get it just leave everything\Nto me all right now repeat everything
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.46,0:16:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,we just discussed start to finish huh\Nwell I buy all the stuff on the list then
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.68,0:16:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,drive around and around in a field until\Nthat's the wrong answer quit screwing
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.30,0:16:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,around and get serious now tell me what\NI said from the beginning you told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.78,0:16:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to drive around an\Nempty lot so I don't get dizzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.32,0:16:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.50,0:16:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you seeing this, Abbacchio?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.10,0:16:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him to stop stabbing\Nme with the damn keys!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.66,0:17:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I never should have put him in charge\Nof shopping in the first place!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.40,0:17:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether you two man-babies want to keep\Nplaying with keys is your own business.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.06,0:17:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,As for me, I'm interested\Nin Narancia's stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.30,0:17:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're being followed, he'll put\Nan end to them before they know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.02,0:17:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why Bucciarati\Ngave him the task he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.78,0:17:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Long story short, I need to get my\Nass back here without a soul knowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.32,0:17:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No stalkers allowed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.50,0:17:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.14,0:17:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My eyes tell me I'm all by\Nmyself, but my gut says otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.18,0:17:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And if that wasn't bad enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.34,0:17:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,this car Fugo got me is\Ngiving off some bad vibes too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.94,0:17:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on now, already!\NI'm dying to know where?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.30,0:17:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh where could you be heading to?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.76,0:17:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia it came from here
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.36,0:18:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,now
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.64,0:18:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,like
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.55,0:18:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I said where are you running off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.76,0:18:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Stranger you keep looking behind you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.30,0:18:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Worried some big, bad boogeyman\Nis following you or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.58,0:18:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Just who the hell do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.36,0:18:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't even act so scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.50,0:18:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that how you treat\Nsomeone asking you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.06,0:18:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't realize you'd be so rude,\Nanswering a question with a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.92,0:18:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your face, freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.98,0:18:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you out of this car right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.60,0:18:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't getting us anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.74,0:18:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You can call me Formaggio.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.66,0:18:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm part of the Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.00,0:18:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You are aware that Polpo\Npassed last night, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.14,0:18:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This sucks ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.60,0:18:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Your trusty team...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.74,0:18:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Merida!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.65,0:18:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about bad news!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.14,0:18:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how this guy found out\Nabout our mission, but he's on to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.72,0:18:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.74,0:18:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if he's a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.14,0:18:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia, this is the rudest welcome ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.40,0:18:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What gives, amigo?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.00,0:18:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Bucciarati and the\Nrest of your playmates?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.40,0:18:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No clue, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.88,0:18:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How should I know where they are?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.40,0:19:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not their keeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.54,0:19:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you check the restaurants around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.20,0:19:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This car you're using,\Nit's a rental, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.06,0:19:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And Bucciarati is the renter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.60,0:19:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you be in this car\Nif you weren't aware of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.66,0:19:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.48,0:19:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I always drive around in his\Ncars, everyone knows that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.94,0:19:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm 17, so I clearly don't have my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.90,0:19:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm borrowing his. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.10,0:19:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, did you hear the news?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.22,0:19:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Polpo's colossal corpse\Nis causing the mortician.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.26,0:19:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,trouble because he doesn't\Nknow how to torch the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.58,0:19:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way to squeeze\Nhim into the damn oven.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.84,0:19:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll just have to hack that\Nfat calzone into tiny pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.98,0:19:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You shut up! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.00,0:19:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you thinking the same thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.30,0:19:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.72,0:19:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.63,0:19:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.18,0:19:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you totally fell for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.88,0:19:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a disappointment!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.04,0:20:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, Narancia, answer something for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.36,0:20:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you fools nowhere to be seen\Nwhile a Cape is being laid to rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.08,0:20:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Get to snitching already!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.74,0:20:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have all day to\Nfollow your ass around!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.32,0:20:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,When I'm finished, kid, you\Nwon't have a secret left!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.08,0:20:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat shit! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.60,0:20:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Better yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.32,0:20:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Drop dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.28,0:20:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.82,0:20:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Little bummer!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.40,0:20:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So he's a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.04,0:20:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him, tiny feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.00,0:20:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.44,0:20:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at what you did to me, bastardo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.58,0:20:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm bleeding!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.52,0:20:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you hurt me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.98,0:20:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.89,0:20:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.81,0:20:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.02,0:20:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Freaking hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.02,0:20:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's a psycho!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.62,0:21:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Die! Die! Die! Die! Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.08,0:21:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't quit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.16,0:21:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll slaughter you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.04,0:21:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This crazy kid's\Ncompletely blown a gasket!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.70,0:21:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's shooting everything\Nin sight like a madman!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.20,0:21:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm stuck inside this\Ntin can with nowhere to hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.68,0:21:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Staying in this car's gonna do me in!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.12,0:21:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the bomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.64,0:21:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Blow him away, little bummer!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.98,0:21:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.40,0:21:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Did it feel good?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.48,0:21:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You a pile of ash yet? Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.08,0:21:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! We get him?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.48,0:21:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.48,0:21:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Did the blast knock him\Ninto the stratosphere?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.02,0:21:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No, just not a piece of him left!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.30,0:21:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.62,0:21:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so oblivious, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.78,0:21:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm right under your nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.42,0:21:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I can micro-fy myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.86,0:21:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my very secret weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.44,0:21:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,My stand is called Tiny Feet, And all the\Nother guys said it wasn't worth anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.22,0:22:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They can talk shit till\Nthey're blue in the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.96,0:22:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But personal talent is\Nall about how you use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.06,0:22:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.34,0:22:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see him anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.02,0:22:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.56,0:22:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd he just disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.30,0:22:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.92,0:22:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The same damn thing happened when\Nhe first showed up in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.34,0:22:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You can look around to\Nyour heart's content.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.76,0:22:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna buy some time while you\Nparade around looking like a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.62,0:22:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.22,0:22:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.72,0:22:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a chick.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.14,0:22:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.28,0:22:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The bastard's buying stuff for a chick.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.46,0:22:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got nylons and lipstick in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.76,0:22:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There's even some designer blush.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.94,0:22:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's all this shit for?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.78,0:22:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This Kagakatsu's mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.74,0:22:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This big sis?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.36,0:22:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.60,0:22:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Women are super picky\Nabout stuff like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.94,0:22:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They buy their own makeup and clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.84,0:22:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The only chick who'd entrust a\Nguy with this kind of thing is one
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.70,0:22:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,who thinks they would be in mortal\Ndanger if they went outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.62,0:22:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This all stinks to high heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.34,0:23:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's looking like my instincts\Nwere spot on after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.72,0:23:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The ones chosen to protect the boss's
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.40,0:23:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,daughter was Bucciarati\Nand his backscratchers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.78,0:23:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It has to be them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.68,0:23:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I will find their hiding place.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.82,0:23:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And the best part is Narachi\Nis going to show me how.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.02,0:23:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,My power should be working\Nits magic on him any second.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.42,0:23:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard's gotta be\Naround here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.62,0:23:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I know he's waiting to\Nfollow me back to the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.88,0:23:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him try!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.46,0:23:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna shake off this\Nstalker and get back to base!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.42,0:23:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And if he tries to get\Nin my way, he's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.90,0:23:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This mission is in the bag!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.50,0:23:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
